option "title" "Chris's books"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-11-01 open Assets:Checking            USD
2026-11-01 open Assets:Savings:HomeBuild   USD
2026-11-01 open Income:Job                 USD
2026-11-01 open Expenses:Rent              USD
2026-11-01 open Expenses:Electric          USD
2026-11-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances    USD

